# 仓库内一律以 LF 存储，检出时也用 LF。
# 本主题跨平台分发（打包成 zip 上传到 Halo），CRLF 混入会让 .properties/.yaml 出问题，
# 也会让与上游 halo-theme-higan-hz 的 diff 完全没法看。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated
.github/page_size_audit_results/*.json linguist-generated
src/templates/components/fonts/assets/fonts/meslo-LG/result-*.css linguist-generated
src/templates/public/assets/lib/** linguist-vendored
